lace_name_jianti_auto":"汴渠","resolved_place_entity_id":3279,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"95138b56-db0e-11ef-ad3a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河","place_name_jianti_auto":"河","resolved_place_entity_id":42,"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"95138b57-db0e-11ef-86e3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"汴","place_name_jianti_auto":"汴","resolved_place_entity_id":256,"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"95138b58-db0e-11ef-acef-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"滎陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"荥阳","resolved_place_entity_id":327,"start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"95138b59-db0e-11ef-9888-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河渠","place_name_jianti_auto":"河渠","resolved_place_entity_id":4868,"start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"95138b5a-db0e-11ef-9e0c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河","place_name_jianti_auto":"河","resolved_place_entity_id":42,"start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"95138b5b-db0e-11ef-9d8c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"太行","place_name_jianti_auto":"太行","resolved_place_entity_id":966,"start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"95138b5c-db0e-11ef-9be5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"上黨","place_name_jianti_auto":"上党","resolved_place_entity_id":364,"start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"95138b5d-db0e-11ef-ac0f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷四十六）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"元和二年，北登太行山，至天井关。元初元年，诏遣兵屯河内，...","context_before":"...间，议退屯巩、洛。郦食其进曰：愿塞成皋之险，杜太行之道。","source_end_index":581,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"31e1dbf3-0a1f-55fc-9d65-9ce6569577da","source_start_index":565,"source_text":"后汉永平十三年，登太行，幸上党。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷四十六）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/◎川渎一《禹贡》山川（卷一百二十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"盖借汴水之分源，迹济渎之余派，非竟以汴水为济水也[汴水，...","context_before":"...谷顿殊，济水之堙遏，当由于汉季之河患，岂真以旱涸之故耶？","source_end_index":321,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"b3c87f3b-f37e-59be-8767-e06dcd22b248","source_start_index":272,"source_text":"又《水经注》云：济渎受河有石门，谓之荥口。石门，此即后汉永平中导汴分河之处[今详见河阴县石门渠]。"}],"path":"川渎/◎川渎一《禹贡》山川（卷一百二十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/◎川渎二大河上（卷一百二十五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"然则河经平原以南，自汉建始中始。而永平以后，尝为河之经流...","context_before":"...南界中。河平三年，河复决平原，流入济南、千乘，复堤塞之。","source_end_index":189,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"9b5f2531-68f9-59d6-a9cd-a76d22664be5","source_start_index":121,"source_text":"东汉永平中，河流合汴，泛滥兖、豫。明帝使王景治之，绝水立门，河汴分流。自荥阳东至千乘海口千余里，十里立一水门，令更相回注，无复溃漏之患。"}],"path":"川渎/◎川渎二大河上（卷一百二十五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/◎川渎三大河下（卷一百二十六）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"然则曹州于汉世，已曾为沮洳之场矣。大约濬、滑、澶、濮、曹...","context_before":"...、郓同一辙矣。○考曹县河患，论者谓始于金之大定中，非也。","source_end_index":1734,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"e412a19f-83ed-5422-a86d-e0368d193c88","source_start_index":1705,"source_text":"后汉永平中，诏书称河汴分流，复其旧迹。陶丘之北，渐就壤坟。"}],"path":"川渎/◎川渎三大河下（卷一百二十六）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"1夏，四月，汴渠成；河、汴分流，復其舊迹。辛巳，帝行幸滎陽，巡行河渠，遂渡河，登太行，幸上黨；壬寅，還宮。","content_fanyi":"夏季四月，汴渠堤防修成；黄河、汴水分流，恢复了旧日河道。四月初四日辛巳，汉明帝前往荥阳，巡视河渠，随后渡过黄河，登上太行山，到达上党郡；四月二十五日壬寅，汉明帝返回宫中。","content_jianti_auto":"1夏，四月，汴渠成；河、汴分流，复其旧迹。辛巳，帝行幸荥阳，巡行河渠，遂渡河，登太行，幸上党；壬寅，还宫。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3588,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"95138b4b-db0e-11ef-b13d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"2冬，十月，壬辰晦，日有食之。","content_fanyi":"冬季，十月壬辰晦，即二十九日，发生日食。","content_jianti_auto":"2冬，十月，壬辰晦，日有食之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3589,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"95138b5e-db0e-11ef-9643-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotat